     2021       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 98 BY 18.27 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
     2022   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2023        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2024        B-mark AT ROW 1 COL 11 WIDGET-ID 14
     2025        b-sel AT ROW 1 COL 14 WIDGET-ID 16
     2026        b-add AT ROW 1 COL 31 WIDGET-ID 2
     2027        b-chg AT ROW 1 COL 41 WIDGET-ID 4
